{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-perfect}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:17ff1f75b450d2aedecb3a1929a4a7726b7ba3fed816ce116e48bde7caefe3b5", "source_text": "Perfect complexes", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b6bdae7edb05023f59d693aec710c2251f9b5ba05ab72faf53161868a3633d2", "unit_id": "tag:08G4:title"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fd274a70bcad3d35b0ab6bdc6ab2302cd95d7875a4400d9f80b3466c8b5d0345", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we discuss properties of perfect complexes on\nringed sites.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7b5aedcc8963e82c9d3e57865d41f5ece9f2c400317c3f6e8a89e72b6b390883", "unit_id": "tag:08G4:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$U$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0008": "$i$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{E}_i^\\bullet \\to \\mathcal{E}^\\bullet|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{E}_i^\\bullet$", "MATH_0011": "$E$", "MATH_0012": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-perfect}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8a9bf1d7bae31374940b341cb65b7b03d1d248cb61f02c1b58b1e2492ec1613e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f556db14173a7bc3227e62089e960becbe12745cd8091c0e259b360b198722dd", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a complex of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nWe say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>perfect<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every object <MATH_0005> of\n<MATH_0006> there exists a covering <MATH_0007> such that for each <MATH_0008>\nthere exists a morphism of complexes\n<MATH_0009>\nwhich is a quasi-isomorphism with <MATH_0010>\nstrictly perfect.\nAn object <MATH_0011> of <MATH_0012> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>perfect<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\nif it can be represented by a perfect complex of <MATH_0013>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b71e01e0f576cb6e45f810d42bbf42e9b19ed86c991936107568b8b639330395", "unit_id": "tag:08G5:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Sh(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0002": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0003": "$D^b(\\mathcal{O})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-section-quasi-compact}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2ab2412fd1b42810f9617c6043979e72df3516b88925f145981ef4dc72a675e4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9f848e0530897ae4e1d0c896781592ec42b523a31b5380c995cced1c9057ed7a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf <MATH_0001> is quasi-compact\n(Sites, Section <REF_0001>),\nthen a perfect object of <MATH_0002>\nis in <MATH_0003>. But this need not be the case otherwise.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8eac92925148de2d18f8b9a83600d5576ca1d3a2472ad880ee85a17cc382cddc", "unit_id": "tag:08G4:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$E$", "MATH_0003": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\{U_i \\to X\\}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{E}_i^\\bullet$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U_i}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\alpha_i : \\mathcal{E}_i^\\bullet \\to E|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0010": "$D(\\mathcal{O}_{U_i})$", "MATH_0011": "$E$", "MATH_0012": "$E$", "MATH_0013": "$E$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-perfect-independent-representative}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3dfe93da967502956208863dba10ca5a3b8f4a56fed84475d6207081f2c293c4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:af8795b9775bb3df2d874536d4884aa9ec160366715c9d1d1ecd3d962ebbc260", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an object of <MATH_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0004> has a final object <MATH_0005> and there exist a\ncovering <MATH_0006>, strictly perfect complexes <MATH_0007>\nof <MATH_0008>-modules, and isomorphisms\n <MATH_0009> in\n<MATH_0010>, then <MATH_0011> is perfect.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0012> is perfect, then any complex representing <MATH_0013> is perfect.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7dbd83f24c8da5e4d77602a951eb1cbd3c2501a010266b2d5597fea5c142ded4", "unit_id": "tag:08G6:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-pseudo-coherent-independent-representative}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f16b2eba3fba740677b98ff4e0288ee93a715ff8de3568ab2401bbadf35fa8d4", "source_text": "Identical to the proof of\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2443e44c9446c12a1e44f35db7aaeec5613de7bd3bdeab4ef3308d73e18ff58f", "unit_id": "tag:08G6:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$E$", "MATH_0003": "$D(\\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0004": "$a \\leq b$", "MATH_0005": "$E$", "MATH_0006": "$[a, b]$", "MATH_0007": "$(a - 1)$", "MATH_0008": "$E$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-perfect-precise}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:10eaa8fa561d1717541022374f476edd94c20ed690daeaf0748fd703b7c014dc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:358e07b6b48d777d73a84e4fe8dc118e240f858a0f961ed5211cfd35608bb61e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an object of <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be integers. If <MATH_0005> has tor amplitude in <MATH_0006>\nand is <MATH_0007>-pseudo-coherent, then <MATH_0008> is perfect.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cae2050294adebbf0224cadba83f4a5d1901e2f91f97b74f53c8091a9d3fc994", "unit_id": "tag:08G7:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "08G4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$U$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0007": "$\\alpha : \\mathcal{E}^\\bullet \\to E$", "MATH_0008": "$H^i(\\alpha)$", "MATH_0009": "$i \\geq a$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0011": "$\\sigma_{\\geq a - 1}\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0012": "$$\n\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet \\to E \\to C \\to \\mathcal{E}^\\bullet[1]\n$$", "MATH_0013": "$E$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{E}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0015": "$\\alpha$", "MATH_0016": "$C \\cong \\mathcal{K}[2 - a]$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathcal{K} = \\Ker(\\mathcal{E}^{a - 1} \\to \\mathcal{E}^a)$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0020": "$- \\otimes_\\mathcal{O}^\\mathbf{L} \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0021": "$E$", "MATH_0022": "$[a, b]$", "MATH_0023": "$\\mathcal{K} \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F} \\to\n\\mathcal{E}^{a - 1} \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0024": "$\\Ker(\\mathcal{E}^{a - 1} \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F}\n\\to \\mathcal{E}^a \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0025": "$\\text{Tor}_1^\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{E}', \\mathcal{F}) = 0$", "MATH_0026": "$\\mathcal{E}' = \\Coker(\\mathcal{E}^{a - 1} \\to \\mathcal{E}^a)$", "MATH_0027": "$\\mathcal{E}'$", "MATH_0028": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0029": "$\\mathcal{E}'|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0030": "$$\n\\mathcal{E}'|_{U_i} \\to \\mathcal{E}^{a + 1}|_{U_i} \\to \\ldots \\to\n\\mathcal{E}^b|_{U_i}\n$$", "MATH_0031": "$E|_{U_i}$", "MATH_0032": "$E$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-flat-tor-zero}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-flat-locally-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:41f4b05e344297f46e625a